  "transcript": [
    {
      "approx_t": 0,
      "text": "Who cares what men think?"
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 2,
      "text": "One thing a lot of guys don't get is that this is literally most women's attitude when making decisions about their looks."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 7,
      "text": "Look at beauty trends: bleached eyebrows, colourful hair, gradient lips, laminated brows, unconventional nail shapes."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 13,
      "text": "This is stuff men literally do not notice or even actively like."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 16,
      "text": "If you're even somewhat plugged into the beauty industry, you know it's obviously not for the male gaze."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 21,
      "text": "Indeed, when Bonell and colleagues asked women why they pursue cosmetic procedures, they reported doing it to feel more confident and better align their appearance with their self-image."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 29,
      "text": "So, who do women actually get cosmetic work done for? The best answer is likely, simply, 'themselves'."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 35,
      "text": "But the full truth is a bit more complicated."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 37,
      "text": "Research by Rodgers and colleagues suggest that beauty ideals are shaped by media, peers, and social norms."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 42,
      "text": "So, personal preferences and social influences are somewhat deeply intertwined."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 47,
      "text": "Do you want us to analyze your face? Click the link in bio. acos.com"
    }
  ],
  "cta": {
    "approx_t": 47,
    "what": "Encourages viewers to get a personalized facial analysis by visiting acos.com."
  },
